      "id": "starter-note-research",
      "title": "Research notes",
      "content": "## Question\nWhat am I trying to find out?\n\n## Sources\n1. Title, author, link or book page\n\n## Key findings\n- Finding, with the source it came from\n\n## Open questions\n-\n\nTip: give each topic its own note and connect them under **Linked notes** to build up a knowledge graph.",
